{"3072400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arm Around!", "steam_appid": 3072400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's way harder than it looks. But just as weird. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm Around! is a delightfully unhinged physics-based game, where you'll face the surreal challenge of controlling a disembodied arm using nothing but your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl, jump, punch and arm around to physically interact with everything in sight as you stumble through Derechín’s wild, history-defining misadventures set throughout the 20th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not THAT weird controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the default controls aren't quite as normal as some would like, they were designed this way for a very special reason: you should be able to control every finger using the same finger in real life, and also be able to extend and contract the arm doing the same with yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If that sounds like too much, there's also a simplified controls mode and you can also change the bindings to ones of your liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take the least amount of time possible!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and one more thing, we're timing you, so if you feel like proving something you can always revisit any chapter and try to beat the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best your friend's time to show off or even get to the top of the world-wide leaderboard to earn a well deserved (and very exclusive) achievement.  Do you have what it takes to get to the top? (Yes, this is a desperate call to the speedrunner community) <br><br>Long live the arm!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's way harder than it looks. But just as weird. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm Around! is a delightfully unhinged physics-based game, where you'll face the surreal challenge of controlling a disembodied arm using nothing but your mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/1d24ed3096a14752fedae97344b6c404.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crawl, jump, punch and arm around to physically interact with everything in sight as you stumble through Derechín’s wild, history-defining misadventures set throughout the 20th century.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/33b670fe8c5f89cffb4973f427f3ef07.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Not THAT weird controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though the default controls aren't quite as normal as some would like, they were designed this way for a very special reason: you should be able to control every finger using the same finger in real life, and also be able to extend and contract the arm doing the same with yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/3ec96c4caee5c861692f7835a1acc4aa.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>If that sounds like too much, there's also a simplified controls mode and you can also change the bindings to ones of your liking.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take the least amount of time possible!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and one more thing, we're timing you, so if you feel like proving something you can always revisit any chapter and try to beat the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.poster.avif?t=1785893825\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.webm?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/extras/8233e568f1c311c53c319ea5e0cd9a4f.mp4?t=1785893825\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Best your friend's time to show off or even get to the top of the world-wide leaderboard to earn a well deserved (and very exclusive) achievement.  Do you have what it takes to get to the top? (Yes, this is a desperate call to the speedrunner community) <br><br>Long live the arm!</p>", "short_description": "You are an arm. Yes, seriously, just an arm. And to be it you have to use your mouse. Oh, and everything is physics based. If it sounds hard it's because it is. Drag, jump, punch and arm around to... wait, what kind of a mission could a disembodied arm possibly have?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/018715c8991b1747d65e2758026637cdab87dd44/header.jpg?t=1785893825", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/b8562e86e7d51e226930c396def8909efe367c5a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785893825", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3072400/b8562e86e7d51e226930c396def8909efe367c5a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785893825", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3 9100F or Ryzen 3 4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1650<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul 